<title>UK: London gold fixes at fresh 40-month low.</title>
<headline>London gold fixes at fresh 40-month low.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gold was fixed at $348.00 an ounce on Thursday afternoon, down $1.80 from the morning's fixing and the lowest level since September 15, 1993.</p>
<p>Bullion dealers said gold had come under renewed selling pressure from gold producers as well as speculators and investment funds.</p>
